# Testing Standards

## Testing Philosophy

- **Critical paths first**: Auth flow, payment processing, booking system
- **API routes**: Integration tests with Supertest or direct fetch
- **Mobile screens**: Component tests with React Native Testing Library
- **Database**: Test RLS policies with Supabase local development

## Test Structure

```
apps/api/__tests__/      # API tests
  api/
    consultations.test.ts
    payments.test.ts
  lib/
    stripe.test.ts

apps/mobile/__tests__/   # Mobile tests
  screens/
    HomeScreen.test.tsx
    BookingScreen.test.tsx
  components/
    ProfessionalCard.test.tsx
```

## API Testing Patterns

- Mock external services (Stripe, Daily.co, Resend) in tests
- Test validation (invalid input returns 400)
- Test authentication (unauthenticated returns 401)
- Test authorization (wrong user returns 403)
- Test webhook handling with signed payloads

## Mobile Testing Patterns

- Test screens render correctly with mock data
- Test navigation flows
- Test form validation and error states
- Test loading states
- Use `jest` with `@testing-library/react-native`

## Running Tests

```bash
pnpm test          # Run all tests
pnpm test:api      # API tests only
pnpm test:mobile   # Mobile tests only
```
